| Process ID | Business Process                   | Key Subprocesses                                                     | Primary Owner             | HR360 Area              |
| ---------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ----------------------- |
| P-01       | Employee Management                | Create, view, update and manage employee records                     | HR Manager                | Employees               |
| P-02       | Department & Role Management       | Maintain departments and job roles                                   | HR Manager                | Departments / Job Roles |
| P-03       | Workforce Status Management        | Maintain work status and determine department-specific active status | HR / Operations / Finance | Work Status             |
| P-04       | Attendance Management              | Record attendance, check-in/out and working hours                    | Operations Manager        | Attendance              |
| P-05       | Leave Management                   | Leave types, requests, approvals and tracking                        | HR Manager                | Leave                   |
| P-06       | Performance Management             | Reviews, ratings and feedback                                        | HR / Managers             | Performance             |
| P-07       | Performance Improvement Plan       | Create, monitor and close PIPs                                       | HR / Managers             | PIP                     |
| P-08       | Training Management                | Programs, enrollment, attendance and completion                      | HR / Training Owner       | Training                |
| P-09       | Candidate Management               | Candidate creation and recruitment pipeline                          | Recruitment Lead          | Candidates              |
| P-10       | Job Application Management         | Applications, roles and application status                           | Recruitment Lead          | Applications            |
| P-11       | Interview Management               | Scheduling, evaluation, rating and result                            | Recruiter / Interviewer   | Interviews              |
| P-12       | Job Offer Management               | Offer creation, sending, acceptance and rejection                    | Recruitment Lead          | Job Offers              |
| P-13       | Recruitment-to-Employee Transition | Accepted offer, joining and employee creation                        | HR / Recruitment          | Recruitment + Employees |
| P-14       | HR Analytics & Reporting           | KPI calculation and management reporting                             | HR / Management           | Analytics               |
| P-15       | API & Data Service Management      | Validation, persistence, retrieval and API responses                 | Application Owner         | REST APIs / PostgreSQL  |

