## 4. End-to-End Process Hierarchy

### Level 0 — HR360 Business Management

Manage the organization's workforce, employee lifecycle, people operations, talent development and recruitment.

### Level 1 — Core HR

* Employee Management
* Department Management
* Job Role Management
* Employee Lifecycle Management

### Level 1 — Workforce Operations

* Work Status Management
* Attendance Management
* Leave Management

### Level 1 — People Development

* Performance Management
* Performance Improvement Plans
* Training Management

### Level 1 — Talent Acquisition

* Candidate Management
* Job Applications
* Interviews
* Job Offers
* Recruitment-to-Employee Transition

### Level 1 — Analytics & Business Intelligence

* Workforce Analytics
* Department Analytics
* Attendance Analytics
* Leave Analytics
* Performance Analytics
* Training Analytics
* Recruitment Analytics

### Level 2 — Supporting Technology Services

* REST APIs
* PostgreSQL Database
* Data Validation
* Business Rule Processing
* Analytics APIs
* Power BI Integration

